{"date":"2010-06-03","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/2e/37/12985_SkSuu.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/2e/37/12985_SkSuu.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/2e/37/12985_SkSuu.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/2e/37/12985_SkSuu.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/2e/37/12985_SkSuu.jpg"},"summary":"　　戴着眼镜文质彬彬的青年，正游走各地收集好看的瓶盖。这一次他搭乘老旧的火车，来到某个海滩边。奇妙的缘分由此展开，眼镜在沙滩上见到一支巨大的红色茶壶，大概有3、4米高。他围着茶壶转了转，俄而从壶的底部伸出宛若章鱼的触角，又从前段探出寄居蟹一般的巨螯。虽然形容怪异恐怖，不过茶壶倒是十分友好。它抛出彩色皮球，和眼镜整整玩了一个下午。直到太阳西垂，游人散去，眼镜才意识到他的朋友没有主人。“也许是一个丢弃物吧”他如是想着，将茶壶带走，既想弄清它到底是什么，又想帮它找到真正的归属……\r\n　　本片由华裔漫画家陈志勇根据自己的同名绘本制作而成，并荣获2010年安锡动画影展最佳短片奖和2010年第83届奥斯卡最佳动画短片奖。","name":"The Lost Thing","name_cn":"迷失之物","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":65,"total_count":102473},{"name":"欧美","count":31,"total_count":86885},{"name":"2010","count":26,"total_count":43611},{"name":"奥斯卡","count":21,"total_count":1861},{"name":"澳大利亚","count":15,"total_count":189},{"name":"剧场版","count":7,"total_count":725866},{"name":"Lost","count":7,"total_count":26},{"name":"Thing","count":4,"total_count":5},{"name":"陈志勇","count":4,"total_count":4},{"name":"2010s","count":3,"total_count":5578},{"name":"cult","count":3,"total_count":342},{"name":"国人","count":3,"total_count":115},{"name":"萌","count":2,"total_count":71362},{"name":"治愈","count":2,"total_count":302360},{"name":"AndrewRuhemann","count":2,"total_count":3},{"name":"动画短片","count":2,"total_count":2074},{"name":"非常中意的","count":1,"total_count":47},{"name":"动画电影","count":1,"total_count":43917},{"name":"独立动画","count":1,"total_count":2490},{"name":"shuan-tan","count":1,"total_count":1},{"name":"四星","count":1,"total_count":206},{"name":"THE","count":1,"total_count":156},{"name":"AM","count":1,"total_count":285},{"name":"Short_film","count":1,"total_count":433},{"name":"欧洲","count":1,"total_count":473},{"name":"澳大利亚动画","count":1,"total_count":3},{"name":"TimMinchin","count":1,"total_count":2},{"name":"动画","count":1,